WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.262
National Debt Fiscal Crisis: $1.2 Trillion and Counting.

00:00:05.212 --> 00:00:15.937
The generation that rationed butter at Ortona, paid off their war bonds, built the Trans-Canada Highway, and left their children a solvent country would be incandescent with rage.

00:00:15.937 --> 00:00:25.150
Their great-grandchildren now inherit $1.2 trillion in federal debt with annual interest payments that exceed what we spend keeping people alive.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:34.650
Every number on this page comes from the Parliamentary Budget Officer, Finance Canada, the Bank of Canada, Statistics Canada, and the IMF.
